Package: zoomGroupStats
Title: Analyze Text, Audio, and Video from 'Zoom' Meetings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Andrew", family = "Knight", role = c("aut",
        "cre"), email = "knightap@wustl.edu")
URL: http://zoomgroupstats.org
Description: Provides utilities for processing and analyzing the files
        that are exported from a recorded 'Zoom' Meeting. This includes
        analyzing data captured through video cameras and microphones,
        the text-based chat, and meta-data. You can analyze aspects of
        the conversation among meeting participants and their emotional
        expressions throughout the meeting.
